          {"id":"tc002txt","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p style=\"color:#888;font-size:14px;text-align:right;\">Last Updated: <strong>[DATE]</strong></p>\n<h2>1. Business Details</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;width:40%;\"><strong>Legal Name</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">[YOUR LEGAL COMPANY NAME]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;background:#faf7f4;\"><strong>Brand Name</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;background:#faf7f4;\">Burans Valley</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\"><strong>Registered Office</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">[FULL ADDRESS, UTTARAKHAND, PIN]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;background:#faf7f4;\"><strong>FSSAI Licence No.</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;background:#faf7f4;\">[14-DIGIT FSSAI NUMBER]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\"><strong>GSTIN</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">[15-CHARACTER GSTIN]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;background:#faf7f4;\"><strong>Customer Care</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;background:#faf7f4;\">[EMAIL] | [PHONE / WhatsApp]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\"><strong>Website</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">[YOUR DOMAIN]</td></tr></table>\n<h2>2. Acceptance</h2><p>By using this website and purchasing our products, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use this website.</p>\n<h2>3. Products</h2><p>Burans Valley sells A2 Desi Cow Bilona Ghee and related products made from Uttarakhand-sourced milk. All products are subject to FSSAI regulations. Physical labels take precedence over website descriptions.</p>\n<h2>4. Ordering & Pricing</h2><ul><li>All prices are in INR, <strong>inclusive of applicable GST</strong>.</li><li>Shipping charges (if any) are shown before payment.</li><li>We may correct pricing errors and will notify you before proceeding.</li><li>Acceptance occurs at dispatch, not at order confirmation.</li></ul>\n<h2>5. Payment</h2><p>We accept payments via <strong>[PAYMENT GATEWAY]</strong> — UPI, Net Banking, Cards, Wallets. COD availability is shown at checkout. We do not store payment card details.</p>\n<h2>6. Returns & Refunds</h2><p>See our <a href=\"/return-refund-policy\" style=\"color:#6b3e26;\">Return &amp; Refund Policy</a>. Returns are accepted only for damaged or incorrect items within 48 hours of delivery.</p>\n<h2>7. Shipping</h2><p>See our <a href=\"/shipping-policy\" style=\"color:#6b3e26;\">Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</a>.</p>\n<h2>8. Intellectual Property</h2><p>All content — name, logo, images, text — is the property of [YOUR LEGAL COMPANY NAME] and protected under Indian IP law. No reproduction without written permission.</p>\n<h2>9. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2><p>Health-related blog content is for general information only. See our <a href=\"/disclaimer\" style=\"color:#6b3e26;\">Disclaimer</a>.</p>\n<h2>10. Limitation of Liability</h2><p>Our total liability for any claim shall not exceed the value of the relevant order.</p>\n<h2>11. Governing Law</h2><p>These Terms are governed by Indian law. Disputes are subject to the courts at <strong>[YOUR CITY / STATE]</strong>.</p>\n<h2>12. Grievances</h2><p>See our <a href=\"/grievance-redressal\" style=\"color:#6b3e26;\">Grievance Redressal page</a> (Consumer Protection E-Commerce Rules 2020).</p>\n<h2>13. Changes</h2><p>We may update these Terms at any time. The date above reflects the latest version.","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[